{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hjl6wIgg05xlRSgC2RMCzw?scene=1&click_id=1963320001","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:47.212416+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hjl6wIgg05xlRSgC2RMCzw?scene=1&click_id=1963320001","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5SVfje3oic2VCp5KqgTYRMFjibQakwOeJZh674yrqWtyKeghPLWW4QLxicSbacNO631l11GWpyMElN8YmwahEjG7xrIHicbGCMcz92nNBmkUX78/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/5SVfje3oic2XAOC22TrewNvIhnnfY089h3bhnw9EdrjrCqG2pjdk5rZTm65vwvDagHFxPWa9icIRaBgibHs7NfpfxeuMjS1vUgcSNNn9cSUGos/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间互动交流，增进学生对我院各学科专业的认识与了解，上海大学悉尼工商学院将于</span><strong><span><span>7月16日举办“2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营”</span></span></strong><span>，欢迎广大优秀学子报名参加！</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、学校简介</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>上海大学是上海市属的综合性研究型大学，是教育部与上海市人民政府共建高校，是</span><span><strong><span>国家“211 工程”重点建设高校</span></strong></span><span>、上海市高水平地方大学建设高校，是</span><span><strong><span>国家“双一流”建设高校</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>上海大学悉尼工商学院成立于1994年，是上海大学</span><span><strong><span>直属</span></strong></span><span>商学院，合作方为悉尼科技大学（2027 QS世界大学排名第87名）。2020年，学院通过AACSB认证。2025年学院在环球教育（Eduniversal）全球最佳商学院排名中荣获\"四棕榈商学院\"，跻身中国大陆商学院排名前十。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><b><span>二、报名申请</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（</span><span><strong><span>2027届</span></strong></span><span>本科毕业生）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>学习成绩优异，本科前五学期总评成绩排名</span><span><strong><span>在专业前30</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>%</span></strong></span><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p></li></ul></section><section><section><p><strong><span>*注：</span></strong><span>在科研、竞赛等方面有优异表现者（如在重要学术期刊上发表论文、获得国际级或国家级竞赛奖项等），上述排名要求可适当放宽。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.研究生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院研究生招生专业如下：</span></p></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><strong><span>类型</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><b><span>专业</span></b></p><p><b><span>代码</span></b></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>专业</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>名称</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>学制</span></strong></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>020202</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>区域经济学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2.5年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>120100</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>管理科学与工程</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2.5年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>120202</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>企业管理</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2.5年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>专业型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>025100</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>金融</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>专业型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>125300</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>会计</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2年</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>1）报名申请</span></strong></span></p><p><span>有意向参加的同学，请扫描下方问卷二维码，或复制链接至浏览器后，填写相关信息。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5SVfje3oic2XvlHSSI8y2JTvPPzMbmdjKn4l5bSHE5709LAmKjUvewzAjIS3ciaBTGiapKWu3vCupYpX5vpM6oYc4gFmicAnADuNFxEFXfZCfqQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>问卷链接：https://tfveubxg.jsjform.com/f/eXocNK</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>2）材料提交</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>请按要求准备以下材料：</span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span>《上海大学悉尼工商学院优秀大学生暑期夏令营个人陈述》；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>本科阶段成绩单、专业排名、英语水平证明（需</span></span><span><strong><span>盖章</span></strong></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>获奖证书及其他证明材料。</span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span>个人陈述模板请复制下方链接至浏览器下载：</span></span><span>https://pan.baidu.com/s/1s95fQzbgYcLHkuH98V1teg?pwd=951s 提取码: 951s</span></p><p><span><span>请将以上材料</span><span><strong><span>合并成一个PDF文件后</span></strong></span><span>，命名为“姓名+夏令营材料”，并通过问卷上传提交。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.申请初筛</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>夏令营的报名申请通道</span><span><strong><span>将于</span></strong></span><strong><span><span>7月13日24时截止</span></span></strong><span>。</span><span><span>初审筛选通过的同学，将在</span><strong><span>2个工作日内</span></strong><span>通过邮件、电话等形式通知本人。未入选的同学将不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三、活动安排</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>上海大学悉尼工商学院全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span><strong><span>将于7月16日线上开展</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></span><span>期间将开展学术讲座、导师交流会、优秀学长学姐面对面等众多内容丰富的活动。具体安排将另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四、常见问题</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>问</span></strong><strong><span>：悉尼工商学院与上海大学其他学院有何区别？</span></strong><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>答：</span></strong><span>悉尼工商学院是</span><strong><span>上海大学直属学院</span></strong><span>，并非独立学院。</span><span><strong><span>研究生毕业证和学位证都是由上海大学颁发</span></strong></span><span>。相同专业的学费、课程体系、培养计划一致，但不同学院文化、师资各有特色。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/5SVfje3oic2XCNzEiaS6kaibIAibZiaYJIcrSZ1NeRf1AThkJszDnYYjJhQszCSJian1O0ch98FFiap0SJj6oibvm4XLBOEWRECKzf0Zg9yI1nkQWBY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>问：</span></strong><strong><span>悉商研究生要求在国外上学吗？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>答：</span></strong><span>国家统招的研究生在上海大学学习，部分双硕士项目同学有机会去国外学习，此外在读期间有很多海外交流学习机会，要积极申请哦！</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5SVfje3oic2XMfHlfJJV1VF3yaXc0eZDfHACwpSctYQ8cVxk1YXLib0niceB5WPCRKD5icwpGmR8g8iacibSTLFBhicGlYfAcriacjqeHbjuk5WQHNc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>研究生参加悉尼科技大学双硕士项目</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>问：毕业生就业怎么样</span></strong><strong><span>？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>答：</span></strong><span>学院有各类产学研基地和专硕实习实践基地100余家，合作企业将提供很多实习机会，学院也将组织各类就业培训和指导。</span></p><p><span>25届毕业生就业数据可以查看往期推送：《</span><strong><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0MjM1OTczMA==&amp;mid=2247561094&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b5fa89048562d315dbbd0e9dbd73c17e&amp;click_id=526667809&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2025届就业质量报告</a></span></strong><span>》</span><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><b><span>五、联系我们</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>邮箱：silc_yjszs@163.com</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>电话：021-69980250，17277968138</span></span></p><p><span><span>官网：<a href=\"https://silc.shu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://silc.shu.edu.cn/</a></span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/5SVfje3oic2Xtf3ys0PDj1WicibWibgJXQoNKftmgKx5XibAICUAfOxAFKCGms2S9KAwSCFPLfSpdPbp2PiamgspGdSWjzyFeUI7nxWNTibicB8ibL94/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5SVfje3oic2WLTro1TBMeklvE3913EBiaP55diciaMvBGFuaBfO8RNtn3r29D6ibaFsj5dth19ZUnx5V6rKBsA7qvjdSDjyxZULIWZTia7JESXoGQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>投稿 / 上大悉尼工商学院研究生管理部</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑 / 张弛</span></span></p><p><span><span>责编 / 刘小卓</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/5SVfje3oic2VE1WdTSV0B466koyAff5elt8kicLEATicopNdZ5MCBehsW8lLiat7EicEHLtIHjCN3jG93WEMOZyOHtqVr8Q4iaBF8xOTYvtaTlT8A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c0f42bf4d2aa6faa57011d22424803d666a77420d30bb9d08e21f6609bc2d8e8","textLength":1431,"sourceSha256":"e73775e94e15ef88d6127a7d33529fd4c828138f799d95c405a8e91bcc8bd0df","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bb885d43915c162cbb46","title":"2026年上海大学悉尼工商学院2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:47.212416+00:00"}
